menuconfig MODULES_CUSTOM_MC_POS_CONTROL
	bool "custom_mc_pos_control"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for custom minimal position controller.

		This is a simplified position controller designed for research
		and educational purposes. It provides basic cascaded P-PID
		position/velocity control optimized for Gazebo X500.

		Features:
		- Position P-control for velocity setpoint generation
		- Velocity PID control for acceleration/thrust generation
		- Simplified thrust-to-attitude conversion
		- No VTOL support (pure quadcopter)
		- No goto control complexity
		- Minimal parameter set
